# Runtime state and generated secrets — NEVER committed.
.state/
transcripts/
faults/fault-log.md

# The fake VM is cloned here by up.sh; it carries its own keys and certs.
openvidu-fake-vm/

# The read-only Grafana token is injected at runtime into .state/mcp.env (above),
